# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# US Election Prediction — .gitignore
# Governance: CLAUDE.md §4/§5, docs/data-governance-and-privacy.md
# The repo is PUBLIC. Restricted (Tier 3-5) data MUST NEVER be committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Data lake payloads (kept out of Git; tracked via manifests only) -------
# Raw/bronze/silver/gold hold data snapshots. We version *manifests* and code,
# not the bulk data. Keep the directory structure via .gitkeep.
data/raw/**
data/bronze/**
data/silver/**
data/gold/**
!data/**/.gitkeep

# Manifests ARE committed (lineage), but never manifests that describe
# restricted vendor/campaign sources — those live in a private store.
data/manifests/**/restricted_*.json
data/manifests/**/*tier3*.json
data/manifests/**/*tier4*.json
data/manifests/**/*tier5*.json

# --- Test fixtures ARE allowed (synthetic only) -----------------------------
!tests/**/fixtures/**

# --- Hard-blocked restricted data (Tier 3-5) — belt and suspenders ----------
# Voter files, licensed national files, CRM/VAN exports, respondent records,
# and derived person/household-level scores must never enter this repo.
*voter_file*
*voterfile*
*voter-file*
*l2_*
*targetsmart*
*catalist*
*datatrust*
*van_export*
*crm_export*
*canvass*
*respondent*
*person_scores*
*household_scores*
*.van
*.pii
secrets.*
.env
.env.*
*credentials*.json
*api_key*
*.pem
*.key

# --- Large binary geo/data formats (should live in the data lake) -----------
*.parquet
*.geoparquet
*.shp
*.shx
*.dbf
*.gpkg
*.zip
*.gz
*.7z
# ...but allow small synthetic fixtures explicitly committed
!tests/**/*.parquet

# --- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- OS / editor ------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# --- Context Engineering files ----------------------------------------------
*AGENTS.md
*CLAUDE.md
*COMPANY_CONTEXT.md
*PROJECT_CONTEXT.md